{"id": "EUVD-2026-94406", "enisaUuid": "48f474aa-6c74-3c99-928a-08a3319ad5dd", "description": ": Session Fixation / Session Reuse across Users vulnerability in Apache Jackrabbit.\n\n\n\nJackrabbit WebDAV server attaches a cached authenticated session on any Lock-Token/TransactionId/SubscriptionId/If-header field token match with\n\nno credential check.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Jackrabbit: from 2.23.0 through 2.23.5, from 2.22.0 through 2.22.4, from 2.20.0 through 2.20.17.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to versions 2.23.6, 2.22.5, or 2.20.18 which fix the issue.", "datePublished": "2026-10-07T15:46:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-07T20:29:20", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/gmbsmrs2lycl9nld7rd0h1r1fc4t75qr"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-92414", "GHSA-3mf8-5fj8-p748"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.73, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1b87c87f-04d4-302d-ab80-834457fe7a7a", "product": {"name": "Apache Jackrabbit", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "2.22.0 \u22642.22.4"}, {"id": "611ae3b8-4c5b-37c0-837f-3aa45fd3bc5e", "product": {"name": "Apache Jackrabbit", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "2.20.0 \u22642.20.17"}, {"id": "e8e441fa-cfd0-3f22-9ff3-1df751dc4317", "product": {"name": "Apache Jackrabbit", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "2.23.0 \u22642.23.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9e91e9aa-abc1-3ea0-9b3c-816c457fab8a", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}